WEBVTT

00:00:06.881 --> 00:00:08.842
Avrora-chan, are you okay?

00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:11.763
The distortion of chaos...

00:00:11.763 --> 00:00:13.716
There's a little bit left, hold on!

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:17.600
Glenda, please!

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:18.513
Da!

00:00:21.479 --> 00:00:22.399
From the front?!

00:00:22.399 --> 00:00:24.482
No way... were they called from Node?

00:00:28.611 --> 00:00:29.654
It is now or never!

00:00:29.654 --> 00:00:31.656
Da!

00:02:02.497 --> 00:02:05.792
Good morning, citizens of Itogami Island!

00:02:06.251 --> 00:02:12.132
I am the one who will deliver information
about Itogami Island faster than others!

00:02:12.584 --> 00:02:14.401
Today's topic is of course:

00:02:15.176 --> 00:02:18.429
The first Primogenitor, the Warlord's
Dominion's  "Lost Warlord".

00:02:18.429 --> 00:02:21.683
The Second Primogenitor, the Dynasty of
Destruction's "Foregazer".

00:02:21.683 --> 00:02:25.311
The Third Primogenitor, the Chaos Zone's
"Chaos Bride".

00:02:25.947 --> 00:02:30.191
The three primogenitors, one of
whom will unite the island,

00:02:30.191 --> 00:02:32.527
I was suprised.

00:02:32.527 --> 00:02:39.826
Yes...it is unusual for the three
primogenitors to show up together.

00:02:39.951 --> 00:02:46.166
You could say in this war you could change
the balance of this world's power.

00:02:46.416 --> 00:02:50.670
I see. It is something that happens
once in every millennia.

00:02:50.795 --> 00:02:51.963
Now is the time...!

00:02:52.213 --> 00:02:57.218
Damn. I don't like that the whole
world is involved in this.

00:02:57.597 --> 00:03:01.389
Well, don't say that. It is a war,

00:03:01.389 --> 00:03:05.226
but for normal people it is like
a festival.

00:03:05.226 --> 00:03:09.728
And? How does it really look,
what's the situation?

00:03:09.752 --> 00:03:15.552
The eastern part of the island is lead
by the Dynasty of Destruction.

00:03:15.653 --> 00:03:19.741
But since there are few people
in that territory, they rank eighth.

00:03:20.116 --> 00:03:23.036
The first is the domain of Tensou Gakkan.

00:03:23.036 --> 00:03:27.093
After all, the First Primogenitor is there.

00:03:27.124 --> 00:03:30.269
Huh? The First Primogenitor is at
Yume-chan's territory?

00:03:30.293 --> 00:03:31.794
What is he planning?

00:03:31.794 --> 00:03:32.962
I don't know.

00:03:32.962 --> 00:03:37.467
And we, the domain of Saikai Academy
are fourth.

00:03:37.634 --> 00:03:42.388
Things may turn around because of the
primogenitors arrival,

00:03:42.388 --> 00:03:47.143
but the changes after last night
were large.

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:52.857
But that was only a reconnaissance squad,
we don't know what might happen.

00:03:53.191 --> 00:03:56.527
We don't know how long will the
Third Primogenitor continue to wait.

00:03:56.527 --> 00:04:00.573
Ah, the Third Primogenitor. I know
where they are.

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:02.200
Really? Where?

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:03.368
Very close.

00:04:03.785 --> 00:04:05.912
Very close, what do you mean?

00:04:06.621 --> 00:04:08.748
At the gate of Saikai Academy.

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:11.960
Huh?!

00:04:12.418 --> 00:04:15.672
She is asking for the domain's
representative to come out.

00:04:15.922 --> 00:04:18.007
She came to play because she is bored.

00:04:23.054 --> 00:04:24.597
Resonant Thunder!

00:04:28.643 --> 00:04:30.186
Damn, there's no end to it!

00:04:30.186 --> 00:04:32.605
Where did they come from?

00:04:33.815 --> 00:04:36.442
They seem to come from the eastern
side of the island.

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:41.614
It seems the rumor that the Second Primogenitor
is on the eastern side of the island, is true.

00:04:41.906 --> 00:04:44.492
The First Primogenitor went where Yume-chan is, no?

00:04:44.742 --> 00:04:47.203
What's that man is thinking?

00:04:47.203 --> 00:04:49.205
What the hell?!

00:04:49.998 --> 00:04:50.915
There she is!

00:04:51.165 --> 00:04:53.793
The ogress with white hair! Kasugatani!

00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:57.297
The representative of the Saikai Academy domain?!

00:04:57.297 --> 00:04:59.465
Kasutani, your head is mine!

00:04:59.465 --> 00:05:00.717
Kasutani?

00:05:00.717 --> 00:05:02.552
You will not escape! Kasu!

00:05:02.552 --> 00:05:02.969
You cannot flee! Kasuta!
You will not escape! Kasuta!

00:05:02.969 --> 00:05:04.721
You cannot flee! Kasuta!

00:05:05.054 --> 00:05:08.474
My name is Kasugaya! Kasugaya Shizuri Castiella!

00:05:08.474 --> 00:05:10.977
Kasuko?! Come...

00:05:11.936 --> 00:05:13.771
Sadalmelik-Albus!

00:05:19.068 --> 00:05:21.779
You don't know the word "holding back".

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:26.409
You did too much, Senpai. Itogami Island is once again in this condition.

00:05:26.534 --> 00:05:29.787
Complain to The Blood who started this in the first place.

00:05:29.996 --> 00:05:33.708
I wish I could catch that brat to get this over with.

00:05:33.708 --> 00:05:36.252
That will be difficult.

00:05:36.919 --> 00:05:37.712
Why?

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:42.550
If the war ends, the rest of the primogenitors will come.

00:05:42.967 --> 00:05:47.305
That's why if you catch The Blood,

00:05:47.513 --> 00:05:50.183
they will interfere.

00:05:50.183 --> 00:05:50.892
Huh?!

00:05:50.975 --> 00:05:53.895
What merit they have in doing that?

00:05:54.062 --> 00:05:54.896
That's...

00:05:57.398 --> 00:05:59.734
One of my objectives is you,

00:05:59.734 --> 00:06:00.902
Priestess of Cain.

00:06:01.861 --> 00:06:07.825
Using the Cleansing's altar, Itomagi Island, you managed to make the Holy Ground Treaty Organization's ships to retreat.

00:06:07.825 --> 00:06:11.454
The one who showed those powerful
weapons' strength was you.

00:06:11.913 --> 00:06:14.791
I thought this was a good chance to get you.

00:06:15.083 --> 00:06:17.210
You don't have a reason to resist.

00:06:17.752 --> 00:06:21.381
The rest of the primogenitors think
the same.

00:06:21.589 --> 00:06:23.383
My life?

00:06:23.758 --> 00:06:26.469
Besides, without all this fuss,

00:06:26.469 --> 00:06:32.558
I couldn't have a chance to fight to the
death with the Second Primogenitor.

00:06:38.481 --> 00:06:44.779
The goal of The Blood is to make the primogenitors
fight each other, and show the strength of
the Fourth Primogenitor.

00:06:45.238 --> 00:06:50.243
With the primogenitors seeking the Cleansing's
strength, they are playing into his hands.

00:06:50.785 --> 00:06:55.081
While we finish, the place of our last
confrontation is going to be decided.

00:06:56.541 --> 00:06:57.708
Most likely.

00:06:57.708 --> 00:07:02.588
So for now, it is going to be hard for
us to find The Blood.

00:07:03.005 --> 00:07:03.631
Damn.

00:07:04.257 --> 00:07:08.970
Anyways, let's move. It would troublesome
if we meet any other candidate.

00:07:11.305 --> 00:07:12.223
Kasuko?

00:07:12.682 --> 00:07:13.766
Yes?

00:07:14.684 --> 00:07:19.605
I'm sorry, I was thinking.

00:07:20.106 --> 00:07:22.442
Are you thinking about the swordswoman
from the Order the End,

00:07:22.442 --> 00:07:25.403
who was using a blue sword like Hawless?

00:07:25.736 --> 00:07:28.781
That woman was an ogress too.

00:07:28.781 --> 00:07:29.991
Do you know her?

00:07:31.076 --> 00:07:34.659
No, but she seemed to know me.

00:07:34.871 --> 00:07:37.290
She spoke like she hated me.

00:07:37.623 --> 00:07:40.626
I see. It is really intriguing.

00:07:46.007 --> 00:07:47.383
Shio-chan, there!

00:07:47.383 --> 00:07:50.136
I see. Glenda, please.

00:07:50.136 --> 00:07:51.262
Da!

00:07:53.681 --> 00:07:54.974
Glenda, return to your normal form!

00:07:57.310 --> 00:07:58.769
Spirit Summoning!

00:08:03.107 --> 00:08:04.150
Are you hurt?

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:08.613
T-the fallen angels couldn't make
any scratches on me.

00:08:08.946 --> 00:08:09.864
Thank god.

00:08:10.114 --> 00:08:13.826
Glenda seems to be fine too, lets
quickly leave from here.

00:08:18.915 --> 00:08:22.001
Glenda, Familiar of Cain.

00:08:22.668 --> 00:08:26.339
I can't believe I met you here.

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:29.842
Your target is Glenda?

00:08:29.842 --> 00:08:33.763
It seems she didn't realize
Avrora-chan's identity yet.

00:08:38.226 --> 00:08:42.522
Sorry Shio-chan, but me and Glenda
are going to buy time,

00:08:43.356 --> 00:08:46.192
meanwhile you should take Avrora-chan
and run away.

00:08:46.192 --> 00:08:46.776
Yuiri...

00:08:46.776 --> 00:08:50.363
-Something crazy like that-
-Don't forget our goal.

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:54.367
We are going to take her to
Kojou-kun.

00:08:57.495 --> 00:09:01.541
Well...We finished eating, let's return
to our main subject.

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:06.462
The war between the representatives is
something inevitable.

00:09:06.462 --> 00:09:08.172
Priestess of Cain,

00:09:08.172 --> 00:09:10.716
Are you willing to working with my army?

00:09:10.925 --> 00:09:13.344
Are you asking me to join your ranks?

00:09:13.344 --> 00:09:18.975
Quite so. I will guarantee the safety of
this domain's citizens.

00:09:21.561 --> 00:09:23.938
Thank you for those words,

00:09:25.064 --> 00:09:26.357
but I shall refuse.

00:09:28.776 --> 00:09:32.238
I'm sorry to disappoint you, but you
misunderstood two things.

00:09:32.613 --> 00:09:37.243
First, I'm not the citizen of
the Saikai Academy domain.

00:09:37.451 --> 00:09:38.953
I'm only their client.

00:09:39.328 --> 00:09:42.248
My real representative is Akatsuki Kojou.

00:09:42.873 --> 00:09:44.834
I don't have a reason to be
protected by you.

00:09:46.961 --> 00:09:48.546
Interesting.

00:09:48.754 --> 00:09:51.966
So you are making me your enemy right here?

00:09:52.466 --> 00:09:54.010
Priestess of Cain.

00:09:59.515 --> 00:10:01.809
Did you finish talking?

00:10:02.226 --> 00:10:04.854
Amuse me, yeah?

00:10:06.230 --> 00:10:07.898
Mogwai, barrier!

00:10:13.821 --> 00:10:16.907
Escaped thanks to the barrier, eh?
Interesting.

00:10:17.325 --> 00:10:19.493
Go, Ishikimiri.

00:10:20.536 --> 00:10:22.330
What is this feeling?

00:10:23.789 --> 00:10:26.542
Are all of these her familiars?

00:10:29.462 --> 00:10:32.089
Don't tell me, the Second Primogenitor's
familiars...?

00:10:33.424 --> 00:10:35.509
Not just the East.

00:10:47.271 --> 00:10:49.857
Damn, it is hard.

00:10:49.857 --> 00:10:53.569
You should be proud of yourself
for making me use my familiars,

00:10:53.736 --> 00:10:57.156
but you will not survive alone
anymore.

00:10:57.698 --> 00:11:01.994
That is your second mistake.

00:11:01.994 --> 00:11:03.037
What?

00:11:03.037 --> 00:11:07.291
Not all primogenitors are our enemies.

00:11:07.291 --> 00:11:09.960
Saikai Academy is allied to another domain.

00:11:10.378 --> 00:11:14.423
The First Primogenitor's Domain,
Tensou Gakkan.

00:11:19.762 --> 00:11:21.347
The kingdom's familiar.

00:11:25.518 --> 00:11:27.603
Aladar.

00:11:33.651 --> 00:11:34.819
Senpai!

00:11:34.819 --> 00:11:36.987
Kojou, what are you doing?

00:11:39.281 --> 00:11:42.076
This is bad. Get away!

00:11:42.243 --> 00:11:44.370
Himeragi, Kasuko...

00:11:46.163 --> 00:11:50.668
Is it the same as last time?

00:12:06.434 --> 00:12:08.227
Go, Shio-chan. Quickly!

00:12:22.283 --> 00:12:24.577
Hikawa Shio, I am...

00:12:24.577 --> 00:12:27.955
It's okay, Avrora. Yuiri will be okay.

00:12:29.707 --> 00:12:31.041
She will be fine.

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:34.128
I ask for your forgiveness,

00:12:34.628 --> 00:12:38.090
My primogenitor, Lost Warlord,
asked me to stop this.

00:12:38.090 --> 00:12:40.509
Oh..interesting.

00:12:51.937 --> 00:12:53.230
Senpai!

00:12:53.355 --> 00:12:56.358
Did you wake up, Akatsuki Kojou?

00:13:00.780 --> 00:13:03.824
I would like to face you here, but...

00:13:04.116 --> 00:13:09.330
Compared to the power of Cleansing,
you will not be enough as a bone.

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:14.627
I have other things to do, after all.

00:13:15.795 --> 00:13:17.588
It was a good visit.

00:13:18.088 --> 00:13:20.841
We will meet again, Priestess of Cain.

00:13:21.592 --> 00:13:22.843
Goodbye.

00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:30.601
I'm tired. What's with all of these
things happening since I woke up.

00:13:31.727 --> 00:13:34.230
Minamiya Natsuki-sensei...

00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:36.232
What's with that look?

00:13:36.232 --> 00:13:38.567
I also went through a lot of problems.

00:13:38.943 --> 00:13:41.278
Sorry, I can't control my power.

00:13:42.112 --> 00:13:44.615
For your own sake, I will not approach you.

00:13:44.615 --> 00:13:48.118
It's not like I wanted to this.

00:13:49.119 --> 00:13:50.371
K-Kojou?!

00:13:50.371 --> 00:13:52.456
Senpai! Hold on!

00:13:52.456 --> 00:13:53.541
Senpai!

00:13:56.752 --> 00:13:58.045
I see.

00:13:58.337 --> 00:14:02.299
This is your last wish, eh? The Blood.

00:14:07.304 --> 00:14:12.726
As expected, around here there is water and electricity.

00:14:17.648 --> 00:14:21.151
Damn. If that two-faced princess came...

00:14:21.527 --> 00:14:27.616
I would like to say
"Put me down somewhere closer".

00:14:28.868 --> 00:14:30.119
Helicopters?

00:14:31.912 --> 00:14:36.625
I see. The injured are taken
care of by M.A.R.

00:14:36.625 --> 00:14:40.296
Which mean they could carry me there.

00:14:46.260 --> 00:14:47.344
I found you.

00:14:48.178 --> 00:14:50.556
No matter how you look, they are not allies.

00:14:50.764 --> 00:14:53.392
Oh-oh, they are swarming.

00:14:54.602 --> 00:14:58.188
You could sneak up to me from behind.
Who are you?

00:14:58.188 --> 00:15:00.190
Calm down, Ojou-chan.

00:15:00.190 --> 00:15:03.319
Calm down, I'm not someone suspicious.

00:15:03.319 --> 00:15:06.071
I don't care if you are suspicious or not.
Who are you?

00:15:06.071 --> 00:15:07.573
Depending on your-

00:15:07.573 --> 00:15:08.365
This is bad!

00:15:18.751 --> 00:15:22.671
That person...The mother of Akatsuki Kojou?

00:15:23.881 --> 00:15:25.507
Why is she treated that way?

00:15:25.507 --> 00:15:27.176
I don't blame them.

00:15:27.176 --> 00:15:31.597
She let the 12th Kaleid Blood, Avrora
escape from M.A.R's facilities.

00:15:32.264 --> 00:15:33.599
Avrora...

00:15:33.599 --> 00:15:36.226
She let 12th Kaleid Blood escape?

00:15:36.393 --> 00:15:39.480
That's why I'm going to save her.

00:15:39.939 --> 00:15:42.900
I would appreciate your help. What do say?

00:15:43.275 --> 00:15:46.153
She may become your mother-in-law.

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:47.780
Mother-in-law?

00:15:48.030 --> 00:15:48.989
Am I wrong?

00:15:49.281 --> 00:15:51.992
You already did it with Kojou, right?

00:15:51.992 --> 00:15:54.620
Eh?! Of course not! Yet!

00:15:54.620 --> 00:15:58.207
Really? But you are a cute lady.

00:15:58.207 --> 00:16:00.668
What's that idiot doing?

00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:05.255
I admit he's an idiot, but I will not
accept you calling him an idiot!

00:16:05.714 --> 00:16:10.094
Besides, what? Saving her is your goal?
Why?

00:16:10.511 --> 00:16:13.180
That's because...she's my wife.

00:16:14.098 --> 00:16:16.308
Wife?!

00:16:16.517 --> 00:16:18.852
I am Akatsuki Gajou. Nice to meet you.

00:16:24.525 --> 00:16:26.443
Onii-san, are you awake?

00:16:28.654 --> 00:16:29.780
Kanase.

00:16:30.364 --> 00:16:31.281
Senpai!

00:16:31.281 --> 00:16:33.158
Kojou, did you wake up?

00:16:33.701 --> 00:16:34.743
Where is this?

00:16:35.411 --> 00:16:37.663
It is Kanon-chan's father's laboratory.

00:16:37.955 --> 00:16:43.168
I couldn't think of another place to
get you to recover.

00:16:43.877 --> 00:16:46.213
In the end, I ended up coming back here.

00:16:46.213 --> 00:16:49.675
How are you feeling, Akatsuki Kojou?

00:16:50.009 --> 00:16:53.971
From what I investigated, there is
nothing wrong with your body.

00:16:54.138 --> 00:16:56.306
I'm fine. Thank you.

00:16:56.682 --> 00:16:58.434
You took care of me once again.

00:16:58.600 --> 00:17:01.645
By the way, why are you eating
sukiyaki here?

00:17:02.146 --> 00:17:06.483
People gave us vegetables and meat.

00:17:06.650 --> 00:17:07.651
The people?

00:17:07.901 --> 00:17:16.243
The truth is while you were sleeping,
Minamiya-sensei took care of 70% of the northern domain.

00:17:16.618 --> 00:17:18.078
Natsuki-chan alone?

00:17:18.454 --> 00:17:21.707
It hasn't been half a day since
I fell asleep.

00:17:22.458 --> 00:17:27.129
The truth is, most of the South is
under one of the primogenitors,

00:17:27.421 --> 00:17:31.800
that's why as a thank you for saving them,
they gave us lots of food.

00:17:32.301 --> 00:17:37.181
In addition, the northern part is full of
people of the Island Guard.

00:17:37.473 --> 00:17:40.851
From the start, it is something
Minamiya-sensei would do.

00:17:40.851 --> 00:17:43.604
I see. Where is Natsuki-chan?

00:17:44.229 --> 00:17:47.900
She went back to the Demon Prison Barrier
to repair the damage.

00:17:48.358 --> 00:17:53.280
If we leave her alone, I have a feeling
she's going to gain more power.

00:17:55.365 --> 00:17:56.658
She was holding back?

00:17:56.992 --> 00:17:59.161
She's strong as usual.

00:18:00.079 --> 00:18:05.876
It's true. Although when it comes to gaining
strength, she's not the only one. You as well.

00:18:06.668 --> 00:18:07.503
That's true.

00:18:11.215 --> 00:18:13.634
Senpai, will you also eat sukiyaki?

00:18:14.426 --> 00:18:17.721
There's no way, please wait a second.

00:18:19.348 --> 00:18:20.933
Ah, yeah...

00:18:22.643 --> 00:18:24.144
Wait, Kasugaya-san!

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:29.108
You may not know it, but Senpai
doesn't like onions.

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:34.909
I have known Kojou for a long time,
of course I know that.

00:18:34.933 --> 00:18:39.219
For a long time? We are talking about
time inside Onrai Island?

00:18:39.243 --> 00:18:45.457
Although it was in an alternate space, it is true
that I was with him for a long time. That's a fact.

00:18:46.792 --> 00:18:49.753
Well, you don't need to fight
over something like that.

00:18:49.878 --> 00:18:54.758
Furthermore, if you eat that much meat,
it's not good for your nutritional balance.

00:18:54.758 --> 00:18:59.680
Senpai just lost a ton of blood!

00:18:59.680 --> 00:19:04.935
For blood, you also need vitamin
in the onions.

00:19:04.935 --> 00:19:07.813
Right now meat is more important!

00:19:07.813 --> 00:19:10.440
Plus, Senpai loves meat.

00:19:11.525 --> 00:19:14.153
Onii-san, there you go.

00:19:15.320 --> 00:19:16.864
Oh. Thank you, Kanase.

00:19:18.282 --> 00:19:19.992
Is it delicious?

00:19:20.284 --> 00:19:22.578
Yes, it is good.

00:19:25.289 --> 00:19:26.540
Onions too.

00:19:28.292 --> 00:19:29.084
Delicious.

00:19:32.713 --> 00:19:34.631
Damn, it's not getting any better.

00:19:36.175 --> 00:19:37.885
Even though I ate that much.

00:19:38.260 --> 00:19:40.220
My appearance is not changing.

00:19:40.929 --> 00:19:43.182
Onii-san, are you there?

00:19:44.975 --> 00:19:48.020
This...Kanase. What are you doing
here at this time?

00:19:48.395 --> 00:19:52.524
I brought you clothes. Can I enter?

00:19:52.524 --> 00:19:54.902
Enter? This is the shower room.

00:19:54.902 --> 00:19:58.739
That's right. If I don't get naked my
clothes will get wet.

00:19:59.740 --> 00:20:03.577
I didn't say that. How did it become
you entering with me?

00:20:03.785 --> 00:20:04.494
Kanase, why-?

00:20:04.494 --> 00:20:05.996
I could hear their voices.
Kanase, why-?

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:08.832
Voices?

00:20:08.832 --> 00:20:10.834
Of the familiars.

00:20:11.293 --> 00:20:13.670
Onii-san's familiars.

00:20:15.797 --> 00:20:18.091
No! Stop, Kanase!

00:20:18.425 --> 00:20:22.429
It's okay. I want to be your strength.

00:20:24.181 --> 00:20:29.770
I can't fight with you like them.

00:20:30.520 --> 00:20:32.522
At least, let me do this much...

00:20:36.944 --> 00:20:38.070
Kanase...

00:20:40.572 --> 00:20:42.115
Kojou, are you there?

00:20:42.616 --> 00:20:43.367
Kasuko?

00:20:46.078 --> 00:20:48.872
Sorry, can you hide here for a while?

00:20:49.915 --> 00:20:51.750
Okay.

00:20:52.542 --> 00:20:54.753
Kojou...if you are in, you can-

00:20:55.671 --> 00:20:57.047
Why are you naked?!

00:20:57.047 --> 00:20:57.297
I was in the bath!
Why are you naked?!

00:20:57.297 --> 00:20:58.966
I was in the bath!

00:20:58.966 --> 00:21:02.594
I was in the bath!
Quieter! Others will notice.

00:21:02.594 --> 00:21:04.096
Then don't enter!

00:21:04.680 --> 00:21:08.392
Isn it a problem for you
if you are noticed?

00:21:08.392 --> 00:21:10.394
Eh? What do you mean?

00:21:10.686 --> 00:21:12.729
Vampire's urges.

00:21:13.647 --> 00:21:18.235
Did you think you could deceive
your former observer's eyes?

00:21:18.986 --> 00:21:22.322
No matter how much you drink,
it never disappears, right?

00:21:23.658 --> 00:21:24.284
Hey!

00:21:25.284 --> 00:21:30.289
No matter how much I wish, I will
never get my homeland, Iroise back.

00:21:30.289 --> 00:21:32.874
But, it is different on Itogami Island.

00:21:33.542 --> 00:21:36.753
We can still go back to the days of peace.

00:21:38.213 --> 00:21:42.092
For that, I need your power!

00:21:42.092 --> 00:21:43.510
No, Kasuko!

00:21:43.510 --> 00:21:45.846
Are you dissatisfed with me?!

00:21:45.846 --> 00:21:50.350
Wrong! What is happening to me now is not just a vampire's urges!

00:21:50.559 --> 00:21:52.811
I can no longer control myself.

00:21:53.228 --> 00:21:55.647
For the taste, the dryness of my mouth...

00:21:55.647 --> 00:21:57.607
needs a specific type of blood.

00:21:58.442 --> 00:22:00.819
Therefore, I cannot drink your blood!

00:22:01.320 --> 00:22:02.571
Then that's even more of a reason...

00:22:02.571 --> 00:22:04.364
to choose me.

00:22:04.364 --> 00:22:04.948
Eh?

00:22:07.659 --> 00:22:17.002
I am an ogre. My body can satisfy you
more than the body of other races.

00:22:17.002 --> 00:22:19.171
N-No, that is...

00:22:29.389 --> 00:22:31.433
Senpai, can I enter?

00:22:32.851 --> 00:22:33.484
Senpai?
